$DIR/test.p:3:5: initialization cycle for x
    Package-level variables are initialized in an order where each comes after
    the ones its initial value uses. Here the values depend on each other in a
    circle, so no order works. Break the circle by setting one of them in an
    init function or at run time.
    (see "Package initialization" in the Plutonium spec, section 15.2)
